# Copy to signal_engine.env and fill in ONLY what you need.
#
#   cp signal_engine.env.example signal_engine.env
#
# The momentum monitor runs with this file entirely absent. Every value below
# is optional for the monitor. Verified behaviour with no credentials at all:
# desk_actions.init_trader() returns "off", the monitor starts normally, the
# symbol table populates, and 1-9 still loads symbols into TradingView.
#
# One panel IS degraded without keys: the TRENDING panel quotes its rows from
# Alpaca directly, so Last, %Chg, Vol·IEX and RVOL stay blank and it shows
# "no Alpaca keys" in its title. Rank, symbol, score and the 52w bounds come
# from Stocktwits and work regardless. The momentum table is unaffected — its
# prices come from the dashboard, which holds its own keys server-side.
#
# NEVER COMMIT signal_engine.env. It is gitignored.

# ── Alpaca (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Needed for the B (buy) and S (sell) hotkeys, the live P&L panel, and the
# TRENDING panel's quote columns (Last, %Chg, Vol·IEX, RVOL). Read-only data
# does not depend on TRADER_MODE — keys with TRADER_MODE=off still quote the
# trending panel while placing no orders.
# CREDENTIALS DO NOT LIVE IN THIS FILE. Put ALPACA_API_KEY /
# ALPACA_SECRET_KEY / FINNHUB_API_KEY in config/secrets.json instead (see
# config/secrets.example.json) — that is the single source of truth, and
# desk_core.load_desk_env() overlays them onto the environment at startup.
#
# Create keys at https://app.alpaca.markets/ — use PAPER keys unless you
# intend to trade real money. Paper and live keys differ.

# off | paper | live.  Falls back to "off" automatically when keys are blank.
# Keep this on "paper" until you have watched the desk behave for a full
# session. "live" places real orders with real money on every B keypress.
TRADER_MODE=paper

# Dollars per buy. Sized into whole shares — never fractional.
TRADE_AMOUNT=1000

# auto = market when the market is open, limit at the ask outside RTH.
BUY_ORDER_STYLE=auto

# % past the touch for limit orders (buys above ask, ext-hours sells below bid).
LIMIT_PAD_PCT=0.1

# Allow pre/post-market B/S.
EXTENDED_HOURS=true

# Bracket exits: auto | on | off. Stop/take-profit as % (0 disables).
BRACKET_EXITS=auto
STOP_LOSS=0
TAKE_PROFIT=0

# ── Dashboard feed (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The monitor polls DASHBOARD_URL/api/state for its symbol list. This is a HARD
# RUNTIME DEPENDENCY — the table is empty without a reachable feed — but the
# URL already defaults correctly in code, so you usually need nothing here.
# Set USER/PASS only if the endpoint starts requiring auth; blank is fine today.
DASHBOARD_URL=https://trading.jbrasfield.com
DASHBOARD_USER=
DASHBOARD_PASS=

# ── Grok / xAI console API (optional, PAID — avoid for this desk) ────────────
# Production uses grok_backend=cli + `grok login` (subscription). Do NOT set
# XAI_API_KEY unless you intentionally want usage-billed console API calls
# (grok_backend=api). Leave blank to avoid charges outside SuperGrok.
#
# XAI_API_KEY=

# ── Not used by the monitor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FINNHUB_API_KEY and MASSIVE_API_KEY belong to finnhub_stream.py and
# massive_client.py. Confirmed absent from the monitor's import graph — leave
# them out unless you are also running those services.

# ── Second Finnhub key, for the engine only ──────────────────────────────────
# The dashboard and the engine each open their own Finnhub WebSocket. The free
# tier allows ONE connection per key, so sharing one starves whichever loses
# the race — and when that is the engine, its realtime bar aggregator is never
# fed and every indicator silently falls back to Alpaca REST bars.
#
# This must be FINNHUB_API_KEY_ENGINE, not FINNHUB_API_KEY: secrets.json's
# finnhub_key is overlaid onto FINNHUB_API_KEY and outranks this file
# (desk_core.apply_secrets_to_env), so a second key set under that name is
# overwritten before the engine reads it. Nothing overlays this name.
# FINNHUB_API_KEY_ENGINE=your_second_free_finnhub_key
